WEBVTT

00:00:11.147 --> 00:00:12.507
(SNORING)

00:00:12.787 --> 00:00:13.947
Shh!

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:23.227
All right, do your thing, knuckles.
Bust it open!

00:00:23.307 --> 00:00:26.227
What's this?
You're a full-on criminal, aren't you?

00:00:26.307 --> 00:00:28.147
Hey, we shook on it.

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:29.987
(SIGHS)

00:00:31.707 --> 00:00:33.627
Thank you, Jeeves.

00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:37.827
What is this place?
Where are the carts?

00:00:37.947 --> 00:00:39.107
You gotta make one.

00:00:39.187 --> 00:00:40.387
What? No, no.

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:42.387
Look, kid, bad idea. Trust me.

00:00:42.467 --> 00:00:44.547
I don't make things. I break things.

00:00:44.627 --> 00:00:46.667
Well, it looks like
you're going to be stepping outside

00:00:46.787 --> 00:00:48.227
your comfort zone, then, Gladys.

00:00:48.547 --> 00:00:49.987
Ooh, this is a good one!

00:00:50.627 --> 00:00:54.147
ANNOUNCER: Welcome to the bakery!
Let's bake a kart!

00:00:54.347 --> 00:00:55.747
RALPH: What is this, another game?

00:00:55.827 --> 00:00:57.147
VANELLOPE: Yeah, well,
it's a mini-game.

00:00:57.547 --> 00:00:58.787
You have one minute to win it.

00:00:58.987 --> 00:01:00.307
-What?
-Come on, Ralph!

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:02.187
Go! Mixing.

00:01:02.307 --> 00:01:03.947
Put the ingredients in the bowl

00:01:04.027 --> 00:01:05.467
and throw away the trash.

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:06.827
Hairbrush. No!

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:08.947
Underpants. No, no!

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:10.587
You're getting all the wrong stuff, kid.

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:12.307
I'm trying!

00:01:12.667 --> 00:01:15.707
Let me up there. I'll do it. No. Yes.

00:01:16.307 --> 00:01:18.547
Gross. Milk. Yes, yes, yes. Oh!

00:01:19.827 --> 00:01:20.827
ANNOUNCER: Batter up!

00:01:20.907 --> 00:01:21.907
Ah!

00:01:26.147 --> 00:01:28.387
VANELLOPE: Come on!
No sleeping on the job!

00:01:29.387 --> 00:01:31.347
Baking! Pump up the heat

00:01:31.427 --> 00:01:33.347
and hold the perfect temperature.

00:01:33.507 --> 00:01:35.027
Ralph, a little help here?

00:01:35.187 --> 00:01:36.187
I'm on it.

00:01:38.627 --> 00:01:41.067
Yeah, no problem.
Give me this thing here.

00:01:42.187 --> 00:01:44.187
VANELLOPE: Okay, good. Little more.

00:01:44.347 --> 00:01:47.387
Yeah, that's it! Hold it, hold it, hold it.

00:01:48.107 --> 00:01:49.187
(DINGS)

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:52.787
Yes! Come on. Get up, Ralph!
Fifteen seconds!

00:01:52.867 --> 00:01:54.547
-ANNOUNCER: Decorating!
-Wheels first.

00:01:54.707 --> 00:01:55.907
-How many?
-Four, doy!

00:01:56.027 --> 00:01:57.067
Got it. (GRUNTING)

00:01:58.187 --> 00:02:00.667
Now frosting. A buttload of frosting!

00:02:00.747 --> 00:02:01.747
No problem.

00:02:08.267 --> 00:02:09.267
Oh.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:17.107
ANNOUNCER: Time's up!
Congratulations.

00:02:17.307 --> 00:02:20.187
You did it, and here's your cart!

00:02:26.987 --> 00:02:28.747
(RALPH EXCLAIMING)

00:02:30.227 --> 00:02:34.387
Look, kid... I tried to warn you.

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:37.427
I can't make things. I just break...

00:02:37.587 --> 00:02:39.067
I love it.

00:02:39.627 --> 00:02:40.627
You do?

00:02:41.067 --> 00:02:42.307
I love it.

00:02:42.507 --> 00:02:44.507
I love it! I love it! I love it!

00:02:44.667 --> 00:02:46.347
Look, it's got a real engine!

00:02:46.427 --> 00:02:47.827
And look at these wheels.

00:02:47.907 --> 00:02:49.267
(KISSING)

00:02:49.427 --> 00:02:52.467
I love it! I finally have a real cart!

00:02:52.787 --> 00:02:57.187
Come on. A work of art
like this must be signed.

00:02:59.627 --> 00:03:00.747
(SNORES) Cream puffs.

00:03:02.427 --> 00:03:03.867
(GRUNTS) Hmm?

00:03:04.027 --> 00:03:05.107
(SNIFFING)

00:03:07.267 --> 00:03:09.827
(GASPS) This is Beard Papa.

00:03:09.947 --> 00:03:12.707
The Glitch is in the bakery!
Get me King Candy!

00:03:17.547 --> 00:03:19.907
Oh, what? You have teeth?

00:03:19.987 --> 00:03:22.307
I don't think I've ever
seen you smile before.

00:03:22.507 --> 00:03:26.307
I'm not smiling. I was... I'm gassy, okay?

00:03:26.467 --> 00:03:27.467
(LAUGHS)

00:03:28.347 --> 00:03:31.387
Hold it right there, Glitch! (GASPS)

00:03:31.787 --> 00:03:33.507
-And Wreck-It Ralph?
-Uh-oh.

00:03:34.227 --> 00:03:35.307
(EXCLAIMS)

00:03:35.467 --> 00:03:37.627
Start the cart! Start the cart!

00:03:38.387 --> 00:03:39.987
What are you waiting for?
Come on. Let's go!

00:03:40.267 --> 00:03:44.587
I don't know how to drive a real cart.

00:03:44.707 --> 00:03:46.067
You don't what?

00:03:46.267 --> 00:03:47.547
Are you hurt, Sire?

00:03:47.627 --> 00:03:50.867
No, he just glazed me. Get them!

00:03:51.107 --> 00:03:52.787
-Gangway!
-Oh!

00:03:55.587 --> 00:03:56.547
Ah!

00:03:56.827 --> 00:03:59.827
Stop, in the name of the king!
That's me!

00:03:59.907 --> 00:04:01.067
(SIREN WAILING)

00:04:04.667 --> 00:04:05.867
Get off the road!

00:04:06.627 --> 00:04:07.867
(TIRES SCREECHING)

00:04:11.067 --> 00:04:13.107
Head for Diet Cola Mountain!

00:04:17.187 --> 00:04:18.827
-Drive into the wall!
-What?

00:04:18.907 --> 00:04:21.667
Right there, between
the two sugar-free lollipops!

00:04:21.747 --> 00:04:23.947
-Are you crazy?
-Just do it!

00:04:26.027 --> 00:04:27.347
(SCREAMING)

00:04:31.227 --> 00:04:32.267
Oh!

00:04:35.947 --> 00:04:39.347
Where did they go?
They should have just turned.

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:44.027
Find that glitch! Destroy that cart!

00:04:44.187 --> 00:04:46.547
She can't be allowed to race!

00:04:51.467 --> 00:04:55.227
So let me get this straight.
You don't know how to drive.

00:04:55.387 --> 00:04:57.027
Well, no, not technically.

00:04:57.227 --> 00:04:58.867
-I just thought that...
-What did you think?

00:04:59.027 --> 00:05:02.067
"Oh, I'll just magically win the race

00:05:02.187 --> 00:05:03.627
"just because I really want to!"

00:05:03.787 --> 00:05:06.067
Look, wise guy. I know I'm a racer.

00:05:06.187 --> 00:05:08.147
I can feel it in my code.

00:05:08.227 --> 00:05:09.587
(GRUNTS IN FRUSTRATION)

00:05:10.147 --> 00:05:12.707
That's it! I'm never
getting my medal back.

00:05:12.907 --> 00:05:16.387
What is the big whoop about
that crummy medal anyway?

00:05:16.507 --> 00:05:17.467
The big whoop?

00:05:17.587 --> 00:05:19.987
Well, this may come as
a shock to you, but in my game,

00:05:20.067 --> 00:05:22.387
I'm the bad guy
and I live in the garbage.

00:05:22.587 --> 00:05:24.547
-Cool.
-No. Not cool.

00:05:24.707 --> 00:05:27.427
Unhygienic and lonely and boring.

00:05:28.227 --> 00:05:31.867
And that crummy medal
was going to change all that.

00:05:32.027 --> 00:05:33.907
I go home with that baby
around my neck

00:05:33.987 --> 00:05:35.987
and I'll get a penthouse. Pies.

00:05:36.267 --> 00:05:38.587
Ice sculptures. Fireworks!

00:05:39.347 --> 00:05:40.507
(GRUNTS)

00:05:40.587 --> 00:05:42.827
It's grown-up stuff.
You wouldn't understand.

00:05:43.027 --> 00:05:44.467
No, I get it!

00:05:44.587 --> 00:05:46.867
That's exactly
what racing would do for me!

00:05:46.947 --> 00:05:48.347
-Well, guess what?
-What?

00:05:48.427 --> 00:05:51.427
News flash! Neither one of us
is getting what we want!

00:05:52.427 --> 00:05:53.587
(EXPLOSION)

00:05:54.387 --> 00:05:56.107
What was that?

